OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'loving' granddad
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has paid tribute to a "gentle,
OL,7,Floving, kind-hearted" grandfather who
OL,8,Fdied in car crash.
OL,10,FWilliam Campbell, originally from
OL,11,FScotland, was driving southbound on the
OL,12,FA1(M), near Darlington, when the
OL,13,Fthree-vehicle collision happened on 4
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FThe 65-year-old, known as Billy, was
OL,17,Ftravelling with his wife and
OL,18,Fgranddaughter, who survived the
OL,19,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
