OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'loving' granddad
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"His final thought was that of the
OL,7,Fsafety of his granddaughter and he will
OL,8,Falways be loved and missed by all that
OL,9,Fknew him," his family said.
